on\":\"VirtualMachineBackup defines the operation of backing up a VM\",\"pluralName\":\"backup.kubevirt.io.virtualmachinebackups\",\"resourceMethods\":[\"GET\",\"DELETE\",\"PUT\",\"PATCH\",\"PATCH\"],\"resourceFields\":null,\"collectionMethods\":[\"GET\",\"POST\"],\"attributes\":{\"columns\":[{\"name\":\"SourceKind\",\"field\":\".spec.source.kind\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"name\":\"SourceName\",\"field\":\".spec.source.name\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"name\":\"Type\",\"field\":\".status.type\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"name\":\"CheckpointName\",\"field\":\".status.checkpointName\",\"type\":\"string\"}],\"crd\":true,\"group\":\"backup.kubevirt.io\",\"kind\":\"VirtualMachineBackup\",\"namespaced\":true,\"resource\":\"virtualmachinebackups\",\"verbs\":[\"delete\",\"deletecollection\",\"get\",\"list\",\"patch\",\"create\",\"update\",\"watch\"],\"version\":\"v1alpha1\"}},{\"id\":\"crd.projectcalico.org.bgppeer\",\"type\":\"schema\",\"links\":{\"collection\":\"https://harvester.invalid/k8s/clusters/c-fwtnp/v1/harvester/crd.projectcalico.org.bgppeers\",\"self\":\"https://harvester.invalid/k8s/clusters/c-fwtnp/v1/harvester/schemas/crd.projectcalico.org.bgppeer\"},\"pluralName\":\"crd.projectcalico.org.bgppeers\",\"resourceMethods\":[\"GET\",\"DELETE\",\"PUT\",\"PATCH\",\"PATCH\"],\"resourceFields\":null,\"collectionMethods\":[\"GET\",\"POST\"],\"attributes\":{\"columns\":[{\"name\":\"Name\",\"type\":\"string\",\"format\":\"name\",\"description\":\"Name must be unique within a namespace. Is required when creating resources, although some resources may allow a client to request the generation of an appropriate name automatically. Name is primarily intended for creation idempotence and configuration definition. Cannot be updated. More info: https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/overview/working-with-objects/names#names\",\"priority\":0,\"field\":\"$.metadata.fields[0]\"},{\"name\":\"Age\",\"type\":\"date\",\"format\":\"\",\"description\":\"CreationTimestamp is a timestamp representing the server time when this object was created. It is not guaranteed to be set in happens-before order across separate operations. Clients may not set this value. It is represented in RFC3339 form and is in UTC.\\n\\nPopulated by the system. Read-only. Null for lists. More info: https://git.k8s.io/community/contributors/devel/sig-architecture/api-conventions.md#metadata\",\"priority\":0,\"field\":\"$.metadata.fields[1]\"}],\"crd\":true,\"group\":\"crd.projectcalico.org\",\"kind\":\"BGPPeer\",\"namespaced\":false,\"resource\":\"bgppeers\",\"verbs\":[\"delete\",\"deletecollection\",\"get\",\"list\",\"patch\",\"create\",\"update\",\"watch\"],\"version\":\"v1\"}},{\"id\":\"monitoring.coreos.com.servicemonitor\",\"type\":\"schema\",\"links\":{\"collection\":\"https://harvester.invalid/k8s/clusters/c-fwtnp/v1/harvester/monitoring.coreos.com.servicemonitors\",\"self\":\"https://harvester.invalid/k8s/clusters/c-fwtnp/v1/harvester/schemas/monitoring.coreos.com.servicemonitor\"},\"description\":\"The `ServiceMonitor` custom resource definition (CRD) defines how `Prometheus` and `PrometheusAgent` can scrape metrics from a group of services.\\nAmong other things, it allows to specify:\\n* The services to scrape via label selectors.\\n* The container ports to scrape.\\n* Authentication credentials to use.\\n* Target and metric relabeling.\\n\\n`Prometheus` and `PrometheusAgent` objects select `ServiceMonitor` objects using label and namespace selectors.\",\"pluralName\":\"monitoring.coreos.com.servicemonitors\",\"resourceMethods\":[\"GET\",\"DELETE\",\"PUT\",\"PATCH\",\"PATCH\"],\"resourceFields\":null,\"collectionMethods\":[\"GET\",\"POST\"],\"attributes\":{\"columns\":[{\"name\":\"Name\",\"type\":\"string\",\"format\":\"name\",\"description\":\"Name must be unique within a namespace. Is required when creating resources, although some resources may allow a client to request the generation of an appropriate name automatically. Name is primarily intended for creation idempotence 