\":\"The minimum number of pods that must be available.\",\"priority\":0,\"field\":\"$.metadata.fields[1]\"},{\"name\":\"Max Unavailable\",\"type\":\"string\",\"format\":\"\",\"description\":\"The maximum number of pods that may be unavailable.\",\"priority\":0,\"field\":\"$.metadata.fields[2]\"},{\"name\":\"Allowed Disruptions\",\"type\":\"integer\",\"format\":\"\",\"description\":\"Calculated number of pods that may be disrupted at this time.\",\"priority\":0,\"field\":\"$.metadata.fields[3]\"},{\"name\":\"Age\",\"type\":\"string\",\"format\":\"\",\"description\":\"CreationTimestamp is a timestamp representing the server time when this object was created. It is not guaranteed to be set in happens-before order across separate operations. Clients may not set this value. It is represented in RFC3339 form and is in UTC.\\n\\nPopulated by the system. Read-only. Null for lists. More info: https://git.k8s.io/community/contributors/devel/sig-architecture/api-conventions.md#metadata\",\"priority\":0,\"field\":\"$.metadata.fields[4]\"}],\"group\":\"policy\",\"kind\":\"PodDisruptionBudget\",\"namespaced\":true,\"resource\":\"poddisruptionbudgets\",\"verbs\":[\"create\",\"delete\",\"deletecollection\",\"get\",\"list\",\"patch\",\"update\",\"watch\"],\"version\":\"v1\"}},{\"id\":\"harvesterhci.io.setting\",\"type\":\"schema\",\"links\":{\"collection\":\"https://harvester.invalid/k8s/clusters/c-fwtnp/v1/harvester/harvesterhci.io.settings\",\"self\":\"https://harvester.invalid/k8s/clusters/c-fwtnp/v1/harvester/schemas/harvesterhci.io.setting\"},\"pluralName\":\"harvesterhci.io.settings\",\"resourceMethods\":[\"GET\",\"DELETE\",\"PUT\",\"PATCH\",\"PATCH\"],\"resourceFields\":null,\"collectionMethods\":[\"GET\",\"POST\"],\"attributes\":{\"columns\":[{\"name\":\"VALUE\",\"field\":\".value\",\"type\":\"string\"}],\"crd\":true,\"group\":\"harvesterhci.io\",\"kind\":\"Setting\",\"namespaced\":false,\"resource\":\"settings\",\"verbs\":[\"delete\",\"deletecollection\",\"get\",\"list\",\"patch\",\"create\",\"update\",\"watch\"],\"version\":\"v1beta1\"}},{\"id\":\"catalog.cattle.io.clusterrepo\",\"type\":\"schema\",\"links\":{\"collection\":\"https://harvester.invalid/k8s/clusters/c-fwtnp/v1/harvester/catalog.cattle.io.clusterrepos\",\"self\":\"https://harvester.invalid/k8s/clusters/c-fwtnp/v1/harvester/schemas/catalog.cattle.io.clusterrepo\"},\"description\":\"ClusterRepo represents a particular Helm repository. It contains details\\nabout the chart location and the credentials needed for fetching charts\\nhosted in that particular Helm repository.\",\"pluralName\":\"catalog.cattle.io.clusterrepos\",\"resourceMethods\":[\"GET\",\"DELETE\",\"PUT\",\"PATCH\",\"PATCH\"],\"resourceFields\":null,\"collectionMethods\":[\"GET\",\"POST\"],\"attributes\":{\"columns\":[{\"name\":\"HTTP URL\",\"field\":\".spec.url\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"name\":\"Enabled\",\"field\":\".spec.enabled\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"name\":\"Git Repo\",\"field\":\".spec.gitRepo\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"name\":\"Git Branch\",\"field\":\".spec.gitBranch\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"name\":\"Download Time\",\"field\":\".status.downloadTime\",\"type\":\"string\"}],\"crd\":true,\"group\":\"catalog.cattle.io\",\"hasObservedGeneration\":true,\"kind\":\"ClusterRepo\",\"namespaced\":false,\"resource\":\"clusterrepos\",\"verbs\":[\"delete\",\"deletecollection\",\"get\",\"list\",\"patch\",\"create\",\"update\",\"watch\"],\"version\":\"v1\"}},{\"id\":\"events.k8s.io.event\",\"type\":\"schema\",\"links\":{\"collection\":\"https://harvester.invalid/k8s/clusters/c-fwtnp/v1/harvester/events.k8s.io.events\",\"self\":\"https://harvester.invalid/k8s/clusters/c-fwtnp/v1/harvester/schemas/events.k8s.io.event\"},\"description\":\"Event is a report of an event somewhere in the cluster. It generally denotes some state change in the system. Events have a limited retention time and triggers and messages may evolve with time.  Event consumers should not rely on the timing of an event with a given Reason reflecting a consistent underlying trigger, or the continued existence of events with that Reason.  Events should be treated as informative, best-effort, supplemental data.\",\"pluralName\":\"events.k8s.io.events\",\"resourceMethods\":[\"GET\",\"DELETE\",\"PUT\",\"PATCH\",\"PATCH\"],\"resourceFields\":null,\"collectionMethods\":[\"GET\",\"POST\"],\"attributes\":{\"columns\":[{\"name\":\"Last Seen\",\"type\":\"string\",\"format\":\"\",\"description\":\"The time at which the most recent occurrence of this event was recorded.\",\"priority\":0,\"field\":\"$.metadata.fields[0]\"},{\"name\":\"Type\",\"type\":\"string\",\"format\":\"\",\"description\":\"Type of this event (Normal, Warning), new types could be added in the future\",\"priority\":0,\"field\":\"$.metadata.fields[1]\"},{\"name\":\"Reason\",\"type\":\"string\",\"format\":\"\",\"description\":\"This should be a short, machine understandable string that gives the reason for the transition into the object's current status.\",\"priority\":0,\"field\":\"$.metadata.fields[2]\"},{\"name\":\"Object\",\"type\":\"string\",\"format\":\"\",\"description\":\"The object that this event is about.\",\"priority\":0,\"field\":\"$.metadata.fields[3]\"},{\"name\":\"Subobject\",\"type\":\"string\",\"format\":\"\",\"description\":\"If referring to a piece of an object instead of an entire object, this string should contain a valid JSON/Go field access statement, such as desiredState.manifest.containers[2]. For example, if the object reference is to a container within a pod, this would take on a value like: \\\"spec.containers{name}\\\" (where \\\"name\\\" refers to the name of the container that triggered the event) or if no container name is specified \\\"spec.containers[2]\\\" (container with index 2 in this pod). This syntax is chosen only to have some well-defined way of referencing a part of an object.\",\"priority\":1,\"field\":\"$.metadata.fields[4]\"},{\"name\":\"Source\",\"type\":\"string\",\"format\":\"\",\"description\":\"The component reporting this event. Should be a short machine understandable string.\",\"priority\":1,\"field\":\"$.metadata.fields[5]\"},{\"name\":\"Message\",\"type\":\"string\",\"format\":\"\",\"description\":\"A human-readable description of the status of this operation.\",\"priority\":0,\"field\":\"$.metadata.fields[6]\"},{\"name\":\"First Seen\",\"type\":\"string\",\"format\":\"\",\"description\":\"The time at which the event was first recorded. (Time of server receipt is in TypeMeta.)\",\"priority\":1,\"field\":\"$.metadata.fields[7]\"},{\"name\":\"Count\",\"type\":\"string\",\"format\":\"\",\"description\":\"The number of times this event has occurred.\",\"priority\":1,\"field\":\"$.metadata.fields[8]\"},{\"name\":\"Name\",\"type\":\"string\",\"format\":\"name\",\"description\":\"Name must be unique within a namespace. Is required when creating resources, although some resources may allow a client to request the generation of an appropriate name automatically. Name is primarily intended for creation idempotence and configuration definition. Cannot be updated. More info: https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/overview/working-with-objects/names#names\",\"priority\":1,\"field\":\"$.metadata.fields[9]\"}],\"group\":\"events.k8s.io\",\"kind\":\"Event\",\"namespaced\":true,\"resource\":\"events\",\"verbs\":[\"create\",\"delete\",\"deletecollection\",\"get\",\"list\",\"patch\",\"update\",\"watch\"],\"version\":\"v1\"}},{\"id\":\"rke.cattle.io.etcdsnapshot\",\"type\":\"schema\",\"links\":{\"collection\":\"https://harvester.invalid/k8s/clusters/c-fwtnp/v1/harvester/rke.cattle.io.etcdsnapshots\",\"self\":\"https://harvester.invalid/k8s/clusters/c-fwtnp/v1/harvester/schemas/rke.cattle.io.etcdsnapshot\"},\"description\":\"ETCDSnapshot is the top-level resource representing a snapshot operation.\",\"pluralName\":\"rke.cattle.io.etcdsnapshots\",\"resourceMethods\":[\"GET\",\"DELETE\",\"PUT\",\"PATCH\",\"PATCH\"],\"resourceFields\":null,\"collectionMethods\":[\"GET\",\"POST\"],\"attributes\":{\"columns\":[{\"name\":\"Name\",\"type\":\"string\",\"format\":\"name\",\"description\":\"Name must be unique within a namespace. Is required when creating resources, although some resources may allow a client to request the generation of an appropriate name automatically. Name is primarily intended for creation idempotence and configuration definition. Cannot be updated. More info: https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/overview/working-with-objects/names#names\",\"priority\":0,\"field\":\"$.metadata.fields[0]\"},{\"name\":\"Age\",\"type\":\"date\",\"format\":\"\",\"description\":\"CreationTimestamp is a timestamp representing the server time when this object was created. It is not guaranteed to be set in happens-before order across separate operations. Clients may not set this value. It is represented in RFC3339 form and is in UTC.\\n\\nPopulated by the system. Read-only. Null for lists. More info: https://git.k8s.io/community/contributors/devel/sig-architecture/api-conventions.md#metadata\",\"priority\":0,\"field\":\"$.metadata.fields[1]\"}],\"crd\":true,\"group\":\"rke.cattle.io\",\"kind\":\"ETCDSnapshot\",\"namespaced\":true,\"resource\":\"etcdsnapshots\",\"verbs\":[\"delete\",\"deletecollection\",\"get\",\"list\",\"patch\",\"create\",\"update\",\"watch\"],\"version\":\"v1\"}},{\"id\":\"longhorn.io.backupvolume\",\"type\":\"schema\",\"links\":{\"collection\":\"https://harvester.invalid/k8s/clusters/c-fwtnp/v1/harvester/longhorn.io.backupvolumes\",\"self\":\"https://harvester.invalid/k8s/clusters/c-fwtnp/v1/harvester/schemas/longhorn.io.backupvolume\"},\"description\":\"BackupVolume is where Longhorn stores backup volume object.\",\"pluralName\":\"longhorn.io.backupvolumes\",\"resourceMethods\":[\"GET\",\"DELETE\",\"PUT\",\"PATCH\",\"PATCH\"],\"resourceFields\":null,\"collectionMethods\":[\"GET\",\"POST\"],\"attributes\":{\"columns\":[{\"name\":\"BackupTarget\",\"field\":\".spec.backupTargetName\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"name\":\"CreatedAt\",\"field\":\