ppens-before order across separate operations. Clients may not set this value. It is represented in RFC3339 form and is in UTC.\\n\\nPopulated by the system. Read-only. Null for lists. More info: https://git.k8s.io/community/contributors/devel/sig-architecture/api-conventions.md#metadata\",\"priority\":0,\"field\":\"$.metadata.fields[1]\"}],\"crd\":true,\"group\":\"crd.projectcalico.org\",\"kind\":\"StagedNetworkPolicy\",\"namespaced\":true,\"resource\":\"stagednetworkpolicies\",\"verbs\":[\"delete\",\"deletecollection\",\"get\",\"list\",\"patch\",\"create\",\"update\",\"watch\"],\"version\":\"v1\"}},{\"id\":\"admissionregistration.k8s.io.validatingadmissionpolicybinding\",\"type\":\"schema\",\"links\":{\"collection\":\"https://harvester.invalid/k8s/clusters/c-fwtnp/v1/harvester/admissionregistration.k8s.io.validatingadmissionpolicybindings\",\"self\":\"https://harvester.invalid/k8s/clusters/c-fwtnp/v1/harvester/schemas/admissionregistration.k8s.io.validatingadmissionpolicybinding\"},\"description\":\"ValidatingAdmissionPolicyBinding binds the ValidatingAdmissionPolicy with paramerized resources. ValidatingAdmissionPolicyBinding and parameter CRDs together define how cluster administrators configure policies for clusters.\\n\\nFor a given admission request, each binding will cause its policy to be evaluated N times, where N is 1 for policies/bindings that don't use params, otherwise N is the number of parameters selected by the binding.\\n\\nThe CEL expressions of a policy must have a computed CEL cost below the maximum CEL budget. Each evaluation of the policy is given an independent CEL cost budget. Adding/removing policies, bindings, or params can not affect whether a given (policy, binding, param) combination is within its own CEL budget.\",\"pluralName\":\"admissionregistration.k8s.io.validatingadmissionpolicybindings\",\"resourceMethods\":[\"GET\",\"DELETE\",\"PUT\",\"PATCH\",\"PATCH\"],\"resourceFields\":null,\"collectionMethods\":[\"GET\",\"POST\"],\"attributes\":{\"columns\":[{\"name\":\"Name\",\"type\":\"string\",\"format\":\"name\",\"description\":\"Name must be unique within a namespace. Is required when creating resources, although some resources may allow a client to request the generation of an appropriate name automatically. Name is primarily intended for creation idempotence and configuration definition. Cannot be updated. More info: https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/overview/working-with-objects/names#names\",\"priority\":0,\"field\":\"$.metadata.fields[0]\"},{\"name\":\"PolicyName\",\"type\":\"string\",\"format\":\"\",\"description\":\"PolicyName indicates the policy definition which the policy binding binded to\",\"priority\":0,\"field\":\"$.metadata.fields[1]\"},{\"name\":\"ParamRef\",\"type\":\"string\",\"format\":\"\",\"description\":\"ParamRef indicates the param resource which sets the configuration param\",\"priority\":0,\"field\":\"$.metadata.fields[2]\"},{\"name\":\"Age\",\"type\":\"string\",\"format\":\"\",\"description\":\"CreationTimestamp is a timestamp representing the server time when this object was created. It is not guaranteed to be set in happens-before order across separate operations. Clients may not set this value. It is represented in RFC3339 form and is in UTC.\\n\\nPopulated by the system. Read-only. Null for lists. More info: https://git.k8s.io/community/contributors/devel/sig-architecture/api-conventions.md#metadata\",\"priority\":0,\"field\":\"$.metadata.fields[3]\"}],\"group\":\"admissionregistration.k8s.io\",\"kind\":\"ValidatingAdmissionPolicyBinding\",\"namespaced\":false,\"resource\":\"validatingadmissionpolicybindings\",\"verbs\":[\"create\",\"delete\",\"deletecollection\",\"get\",\"list\",\"patch\",\"update\",\"watch\"],\"version\":\"v1\"}},{\"id\":\"monitoring.coreos.com.alertmanagerconfig\",\"type\":\"schema\",\"links\":{\"collection\":\"https://harvester.invalid/k8s/clusters/c-fwtnp/v1/harvester/monitoring.coreos.com.alertmanagerconfigs\",\"self\":\"https://harvester.i