e parameters and credentials required to interact with various LLM providers.\",\"pluralName\":\"hub.traefik.io.aiservices\",\"resourceMethods\":[\"GET\",\"DELETE\",\"PUT\",\"PATCH\",\"PATCH\"],\"resourceFields\":null,\"collectionMethods\":[\"GET\",\"POST\"],\"attributes\":{\"columns\":[{\"name\":\"Name\",\"type\":\"string\",\"format\":\"name\",\"description\":\"Name must be unique within a namespace. Is required when creating resources, although some resources may allow a client to request the generation of an appropriate name automatically. Name is primarily intended for creation idempotence and configuration definition. Cannot be updated. More info: https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/overview/working-with-objects/names#names\",\"priority\":0,\"field\":\"$.metadata.fields[0]\"},{\"name\":\"Age\",\"type\":\"date\",\"format\":\"\",\"description\":\"CreationTimestamp is a timestamp representing the server time when this object was created. It is not guaranteed to be set in happens-before order across separate operations. Clients may not set this value. It is represented in RFC3339 form and is in UTC.\\n\\nPopulated by the system. Read-only. Null for lists. More info: https://git.k8s.io/community/contributors/devel/sig-architecture/api-conventions.md#metadata\",\"priority\":0,\"field\":\"$.metadata.fields[1]\"}],\"crd\":true,\"group\":\"hub.traefik.io\",\"kind\":\"AIService\",\"namespaced\":true,\"resource\":\"aiservices\",\"verbs\":[\"delete\",\"deletecollection\",\"get\",\"list\",\"patch\",\"create\",\"update\",\"watch\"],\"version\":\"v1alpha1\"}},{\"id\":\"traefik.io.middlewaretcp\",\"type\":\"schema\",\"links\":{\"collection\":\"https://harvester.invalid/k8s/clusters/c-fwtnp/v1/harvester/traefik.io.middlewaretcps\",\"self\":\"https://harvester.invalid/k8s/clusters/c-fwtnp/v1/harvester/schemas/traefik.io.middlewaretcp\"},\"description\":\"MiddlewareTCP is the CRD implementation of a Traefik TCP middleware.\\nMore info: https://doc.traefik.io/traefik/v3.7/reference/routing-configuration/tcp/middlewares/overview/\",\"pluralName\":\"traefik.io.middlewaretcps\",\"resourceMethods\":[\"GET\",\"DELETE\",\"PUT\",\"PATCH\",\"PATCH\"],\"resourceFields\":null,\"collectionMethods\":[\"GET\",\"POST\"],\"attributes\":{\"columns\":[{\"name\":\"Name\",\"type\":\"string\",\"format\":\"name\",\"description\":\"Name must be unique within a namespace. Is required when creating resources, although some resources may allow a client to request the generation of an appropriate name automatically. Name is primarily intended for creation idempotence and configuration definition. Cannot be updated. More info: https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/overview/working-with-objects/names#names\",\"priority\":0,\"field\":\"$.metadata.fields[0]\"},{\"name\":\"Age\",\"type\":\"date\",\"format\":\"\",\"description\":\"CreationTimestamp is a timestamp representing the server time when this object was created. It is not guaranteed to be set in happens-before order across separate operations. Clients may not set this value. It is represented in RFC3339 form and is in UTC.\\n\\nPopulated by the system. Read-only. Null for lists. More info: https://git.k8s.io/community/contributors/devel/sig-architecture/api-conventions.md#metadata\",\"priority\":0,\"field\":\"$.metadata.fields[1]\"}],\"crd\":true,\"group\":\"traefik.io\",\"kind\":\"MiddlewareTCP\",\"namespaced\":true,\"resource\":\"middlewaretcps\",\"verbs\":[\"delete\",\"deletecollection\",\"get\",\"list\",\"patch\",\"create\",\"update\",\"watch\"],\"version\":\"v1alpha1\"}},{\"id\":\"serviceaccount\",\"type\":\"schema\",\"links\":{\"collection\":\"https://harvester.invalid/k8s/clusters/c-fwtnp/v1/harvester/serviceaccounts\",\"self\":\"https://harvester.invalid/k8s/clusters/c-fwtnp/v1/harvester/schemas/serviceaccount\"},\"description\":\"ServiceAccount binds together: * a name, understood by users, and perhaps by peripheral systems, for an identity * a principal that can be authenticated and authorized * a set of s