"update\",\"watch\"],\"version\":\"v1alpha1\"}},{\"id\":\"storage.k8s.io.volumeattachment\",\"type\":\"schema\",\"links\":{\"collection\":\"https://harvester.invalid/v1/storage.k8s.io.volumeattachments\",\"self\":\"https://harvester.invalid/v1/schemas/storage.k8s.io.volumeattachment\"},\"description\":\"VolumeAttachment captures the intent to attach or detach the specified volume to/from the specified node.\\n\\nVolumeAttachment objects are non-namespaced.\",\"pluralName\":\"storage.k8s.io.volumeattachments\",\"resourceMethods\":[\"GET\",\"DELETE\",\"PUT\",\"PATCH\"],\"resourceFields\":null,\"collectionMethods\":[\"GET\",\"POST\"],\"attributes\":{\"columns\":[{\"name\":\"Name\",\"type\":\"string\",\"format\":\"name\",\"description\":\"Name must be unique within a namespace. Is required when creating resources, although some resources may allow a client to request the generation of an appropriate name automatically. Name is primarily intended for creation idempotence and configuration definition. Cannot be updated. More info: https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/overview/working-with-objects/names#names\",\"priority\":0,\"field\":\"$.metadata.fields[0]\"},{\"name\":\"Attacher\",\"type\":\"string\",\"format\":\"name\",\"description\":\"attacher indicates the name of the volume driver that MUST handle this request. This is the name returned by GetPluginName().\",\"priority\":0,\"field\":\"$.metadata.fields[1]\"},{\"name\":\"PV\",\"type\":\"string\",\"format\":\"\",\"description\":\"persistentVolumeName represents the name of the persistent volume to attach.\",\"priority\":0,\"field\":\"$.metadata.fields[2]\"},{\"name\":\"Node\",\"type\":\"string\",\"format\":\"\",\"description\":\"nodeName represents the node that the volume should be attached to.\",\"priority\":0,\"field\":\"$.metadata.fields[3]\"},{\"name\":\"Attached\",\"type\":\"boolean\",\"format\":\"\",\"description\":\"attached indicates the volume is successfully attached. This field must only be set by the enti