creation idempotence and configuration definition. Cannot be updated. More info: https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/overview/working-with-objects/names#names\",\"priority\":1,\"field\":\"$.metadata.fields[9]\"}],\"group\":\"\",\"kind\":\"Event\",\"namespaced\":true,\"resource\":\"events\",\"verbs\":[\"create\",\"delete\",\"deletecollection\",\"get\",\"list\",\"patch\",\"update\",\"watch\"],\"version\":\"v1\"}},{\"id\":\"traefik.io.tlsstore\",\"type\":\"schema\",\"links\":{\"collection\":\"https://harvester.invalid/v1/traefik.io.tlsstores\",\"self\":\"https://harvester.invalid/v1/schemas/traefik.io.tlsstore\"},\"description\":\"TLSStore is the CRD implementation of a Traefik TLS Store.\\nFor the time being, only the TLSStore named default is supported.\\nThis means that you cannot have two stores that are named default in different Kubernetes namespaces.\\nMore info: https://doc.traefik.io/traefik/v3.5/https/tls/#certificates-stores\",\"pluralName\":\"traefik.io.tlsstores\",\"resourceMethods\":[\"PUT\",\"PATCH\",\"GET\",\"DELETE\"],\"resourceFields\":null,\"collectionMethods\":[\"GET\",\"POST\"],\"attributes\":{\"columns\":[{\"name\":\"Name\",\"type\":\"string\",\"format\":\"name\",\"description\":\"Name must be unique within a namespace. Is required when creating resources, although some resources may allow a client to request the generation of an appropriate name automatically. Name is primarily intended for creation idempotence and configuration definition. Cannot be updated. More info: https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/overview/working-with-objects/names#names\",\"priority\":0,\"field\":\"$.metadata.fields[0]\"},{\"name\":\"Age\",\"type\":\"date\",\"format\":\"\",\"description\":\"CreationTimestamp is a timestamp representing the server time when this object was created. It is not guaranteed to be set in happens-before order across separate operations. Clients may not set this value. It is represented in RFC3339 form and is in UTC.\\n\\nPopulated by the system. Read-only. Null for lists. More info: https://git.k8s.io/community/contributors/devel/sig-architecture/api-conventions.md#metadata\",\"priority\":0,\"field\":\"$.metadata.fields[1]\"}],\"crd\":true,\"crdJSONPathParsers\":{\"Age\":\"{.metadata.creationTimestamp}\",\"Name\":\"{.metadata.name}\"},\"group\":\"traefik.io\",\"kind\":\"TLSStore\",\"namespaced\":true,\"resource\":\"tlsstores\",\"verbs\":[\"delete\",\"deletecollection\",\"get\",\"list\",\"patch\",\"create\",\"update\",\"watch\"],\"version\":\"v1alpha1\"}},{\"id\":\"turtles-capi.cattle.io.capiprovider\",\"type\":\"schema\",\"links\":{\"collection\":\"https://harvester.invalid/v1/turtles-capi.cattle.io.capiproviders\",\"self\":\"https://harvester.invalid/v1/schemas/turtles-capi.cattle.io.capiprovider\"},\"description\":\"CAPIProvider is the Schema for the CAPI Providers API.\",\"pluralName\":\"turtles-capi.cattle.io.capiproviders\",\"resourceMethods\":[\"PUT\",\"PATCH\",\"GET\",\"DELETE\"],\"resourceFields\":null,\"collectionMethods\":[\"GET\",\"POST\"],\"attributes\":{\"columns\":[{\"name\":\"Name\",\"type\":\"string\",\"format\":\"name\",\"description\":\"Name must be unique within a namespace. Is required when creating resources, although some resources may allow a client to request the generation of an appropriate name automatically. Name is primarily intended for creation idempotence and configuration definition. Cannot be updated. More info: https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/overview/working-with-objects/names#names\",\"priority\":0,\"field\":\"$.metadata.fields[0]\"},{\"name\":\"Type\",\"type\":\"string\",\"format\":\"\",\"description\":\"Custom resource definition column (in JSONPath format): .spec.type\",\"priority\":0,\"field\":\"$.metadata.fields[1]\"},{\"name\":\"ProviderName\",\"type\":\"string\",\"format\":\"\",\"description\":\"Custom resource definition column (in JSONPath format): .status.name\",\"priority\":0,\"field\":\"$.metadata.fields[2]\"},{\"name\":\"InstalledVersion\",\"type\":\"st