 generation of an appropriate name automatically. Name is primarily intended for creation idempotence and configuration definition. Cannot be updated. More info: https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/overview/working-with-objects/names#names\",\"priority\":0,\"field\":\"$.metadata.fields[0]\"},{\"name\":\"TTL\",\"type\":\"string\",\"format\":\"\",\"description\":\"TTL is the time-to-live for the Kubeconfig tokens\",\"priority\":0,\"field\":\"$.metadata.fields[1]\"},{\"name\":\"Tokens\",\"type\":\"string\",\"format\":\"\",\"description\":\"Tokens is the number of tokens created for the Kubeconfig\",\"priority\":0,\"field\":\"$.metadata.fields[2]\"},{\"name\":\"Status\",\"type\":\"string\",\"format\":\"\",\"description\":\"Status is the most recently observed status of the Kubeconfig\",\"priority\":0,\"field\":\"$.metadata.fields[3]\"},{\"name\":\"Age\",\"type\":\"string\",\"format\":\"\",\"description\":\"CreationTimestamp is a timestamp representing the server time when this object was created. It is not guaranteed to be set in happens-before order across separate operations. Clients may not set this value. It is represented in RFC3339 form and is in UTC.\\n\\nPopulated by the system. Read-only. Null for lists. More info: https://git.k8s.io/community/contributors/devel/sig-architecture/api-conventions.md#metadata\",\"priority\":0,\"field\":\"$.metadata.fields[4]\"},{\"name\":\"User\",\"type\":\"string\",\"format\":\"\",\"description\":\"User is the owner of the Kubeconfig\",\"priority\":1,\"field\":\"$.metadata.fields[5]\"},{\"name\":\"Clusters\",\"type\":\"string\",\"format\":\"\",\"description\":\"Clusters is a list of clusters in the Kubeconfig\",\"priority\":1,\"field\":\"$.metadata.fields[6]\"},{\"name\":\"Description\",\"type\":\"string\",\"format\":\"\",\"description\":\"Description is a human readable description of the Kubeconfig\",\"priority\":1,\"field\":\"$.metadata.fields[7]\"}],\"group\":\"ext.cattle.io\",\"kind\":\"Kubeconfig\",\"namespaced\":false,\"re