t IPv6 address assigned to the instance should be marked as the primary IPv6 address. Enable this option if the instance requires a stable, non-changing IPv6 address. This option does not affect whether IPv6 addresses are assigned to the instance.\",\"dynamicField\":true,\"type\":\"boolean\",\"update\":true},\"encryptEbsVolume\":{\"create\":true,\"default\":false,\"description\":\"Encrypt the EBS volume using the AWS Managed CMK\",\"dynamicField\":true,\"type\":\"boolean\",\"update\":true},\"endpoint\":{\"create\":true,\"default\":\"\",\"description\":\"Optional endpoint URL (hostname only or fully qualified URI)\",\"dynamicField\":true,\"type\":\"string\",\"update\":true},\"httpEndpoint\":{\"create\":true,\"default\":\"\",\"description\":\"Enables or disables the HTTP metadata endpoint on your instances\",\"dynamicField\":true,\"type\":\"string\",\"update\":true},\"httpProtocolIpv6\":{\"create\":true,\"default\":\"disabled\",\"description\":\"Enables or disables the IPv6 endpoint for the instance metadata service. Options: enabled, disabled (default).\",\"dynamicField\":true,\"type\":\"string\",\"update\":true},\"httpTokens\":{\"create\":true,\"default\":\"\",\"description\":\"The state of token usage for your instance metadata requests.\",\"dynamicField\":true,\"type\":\"string\",\"update\":true},\"iamInstanceProfile\":{\"create\":true,\"default\":\"\",\"description\":\"AWS IAM Instance Profile\",\"dynamicField\":true,\"type\":\"string\",\"update\":true},\"insecureTransport\":{\"create\":true,\"default\":false,\"description\":\"Disable SSL when sending requests\",\"dynamicField\":true,\"type\":\"boolean\",\"update\":true},\"instanceType\":{\"create\":true,\"default\":\"t2.micro\",\"description\":\"AWS instance type\",\"dynamicField\":true,\"type\":\"string\",\"update\":true},\"ipv6AddressCount\":{\"create\":true,\"default\":\"0\",\"description\":\"The number of IPv6 addresses to assign to the network interface (default: 0). Must be greater than zero when amazonec2